Step 2: Best Root Node

We check which feature best separates Yes and No.

From the table:

Raining = No

Walk = Yes (3 times), No (1 time) → Mostly Yes

Raining = Yes

Walk = Yes (1 time), No (3 times) → Mostly No

So Raining is the best root node.

